## 8. DAX Functions Used

| DAX Function | Purpose |
|---|---|
| SUM() | Calculates total values |
| DIVIDE() | Performs safe division |
| DISTINCTCOUNT() | Counts unique values |
| CALCULATE() | Modifies filter context |
| FILTER() | Filters table rows |
| TOPN() | Returns top-ranked records |
| ALLSELECTED() | Respects external selections |
| VALUES() | Returns distinct values |
| COUNTROWS() | Counts table rows |
| DATEADD() | Performs date-based calculations |
| CONCATENATEX() | Combines text values |

